{"ticker":{"symbol":"290270.KQ","name":"휴네시온","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":2160.0,"change_pct":-0.04424778761061943,"market_cap":19927984128.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":0.023148148148148147,"week52_low":0.0,"week52_high":5720.0,"sector":"Technology","industry":"Software - Application","country":"South Korea","city":"Seoul","employees":170,"website":"https://www.hunesion.com","business_summary":"Hunesion Co.,Ltd develops and supplies IT security solutions. The company offers i-oneNet, a secure data transmission solution; i-oneNet DD, a one-way network connectivity solution; i-oneNet DX, a dual unidirectional network connection solution; and i-Spector, a network traffic collection and analysis solutions. It also provides TresDM, an intelligent malware detection solution; NGS, a system access control and account management solution; CamPASS, a CCTV password management solution; MoBiCa, an enterprise mobile device management solution; and ViSiCa, a visit and safety management solution. The company was founded in 2003 and is based in Seoul, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"(주)휴네시온은 IT 보안 솔루션을 개발, 공급하고 있습니다. 안전한 데이터 전송 솔루션인 i-oneNet을 제공합니다. 단방향 네트워크 연결 솔루션인 i-oneNet DD; 이중 단방향 네트워크 연결 솔루션인 i-oneNet DX; 네트워크 트래픽 수집 및 분석 솔루션인 i-Spector가 있습니다. 또한 지능형 악성코드 탐지 솔루션인 TresDM도 제공합니다. 시스템 접근 제어 및 계정 관리 솔루션인 NGS; CCTV 비밀번호 관리 솔루션 CamPASS; 기업용 모바일 기기 관리 솔루션인 MoBiCa; 방문 및 안전관리 솔루션 ViSiCa 등이 있습니다. 이 회사는 2003년에 설립되었으며 대한민국 서울에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"응용 소프트웨어","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":30423152330.0,"operating_income":3418605580.0,"net_income":-5195917560.0,"eps":-553.0},{"period":"2023","revenue":36140422010.0,"operating_income":4662573800.0,"net_income":6738379480.0,"eps":720.0},{"period":"2024","revenue":36892798610.0,"operating_income":31537